==Strategy==
Welcome to the "new" Otherworld Colosseum, where instead of being a Cash Limit like Trust Fund, you're limited in how many units you can send out. Once you send out 60 units, it's over. Because of this, spammy units like [[Manic Eraser Cat]] are discouraged.

This stage is a basic Black/Relic stage to get you warmed up for the 60 unit restriction. [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] and [[Royal Guard Cat]] still work here, albeit with a bit more caution as sending out too many badly timed Dumplings or Guards can easily eat up the unit limit. [[Pizza Cat]] and Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] can deal with the SBKs. An Othom appears here, but it dies to [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]]. Once that's done, you have to cleanup Kurosawah. Use units like [[Bombercat]] to try and Freeze lock him for as long as possible, while using C.A.T and [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to deal with his high health pool.

